  "actual_subdivision": "Unreversed ordinal join [n] -> [n] star [n], first-half endpoint.",
  "final_statement": "For a genuine cofibration sequence F -> G -> H of exact functors, the original KMap of G is the pointwise product KMap F * KMap H, in this order, in every nonnegative K-degree. The actual pre-existing K-group multiplication is commutative also in degree zero.",
